  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the garlic (or use a garlic press). In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over a medium heat. Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the basmati rice, water (for the rice) and the salt and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from the heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam  so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-e315365b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice the brown onion. Cut the capsicum into 1cm pieces. Grate the carrot (unpeeled) and zucchini. Drain the sweetcorn. Drain and rinse the black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-9a473f71.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat. Add the onion, capsicum and sweetcorn and cook until softened and starting to char, 4-5 minutes. Reduce the heat to medium-high and add the carrot, zucchini and black beans. Cook until tender, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-35a7b9e4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the All-American spice blend, smoked paprika, the remaining butter and the remaining garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the diced tomatoes with garlic & olive oil, water (for the sauce) and crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2 people / 2 cubes for 4 people). Simmer until slightly thickened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-594d0394.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chilli is cooking, thinly slice the spring onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-da9ad540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the garlic rice and smokey black bean chilli between bowls. Crumble over the fetta and garnish with the spring onion to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ee039e9fc0f42508e1a72ae/step-0a0493c3.jpg"
    }
  ]
